        "created_at": "2015-12-06T17:44:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Vs. Plague Rat, with undaunted on Fanatic and Lead from the front in play for Greatest Legacy it gave me the option to choose which would take place first, Undaunted preventing the damage or Lead from the front redirecting it.</p><p>As I understand Prevention should work like immunity in this case, and fall under the Damage that cannot be dealt cannot be redirected rule.</p><p>I let it be redirected and it did hit Legacy with 1 melee damage.</p><p>I can't get the same result when using Hypersonic or Throat Jab, so I assume it is a mistake.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:54.704Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
