      {
        "id": 151273,
        "name": "jorgenp",
        "username": "jorgenp",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-06T17:55:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the difference here is that Undaunted triggers only when Fanatic 'would be dealt' 1 damage.&nbsp; This is the same timing as redirection abilities, that trigger when a target would be dealt any amount of damage.&nbsp; Other methods of preventing damage, including the ones given here, prevent damage dealt by a target unconditionally, which is why they take precedence.</p>",
