        "id": 151275,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-06T20:32:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I throat Jabbed Plague Rat it did not ask if I wanted to redirect attacks, it simply said Rat couldn't deal damage.</p><p>That is as expected. &nbsp;</p><p>Undaunted/Lead from the front was allowing shots of 1 damage to be redirected away from fanatic, when they should be prevented by Undaunted. &nbsp;That should not be possible, because you cannot redirect damage unless the damage can be dealt.</p>",
