      {
        "id": 151276,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-06T20:41:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it's working as expected on all ends. &nbsp; You don't get a prompt about Lead From the Front after preventing damage due to Throat Jab or Hypersonic Assault because the damage is being prevented before they would attempt to deal the damage. &nbsp; In of Undaunted you have to accept the damage before it is prevented for only being one damage and thus Lead From the Front can react at the same time. &nbsp; &nbsp;I would expect to see the same prompts if a Stealth Bot was out and Fanatic with Undaunted out was about to be dealt one damage. &nbsp; To me a better example to compare against is having AZ dealt cold damage from a villain target when he has Null Point Calibration Unit out instead of preventing villain damage through Throat Jab or Hypersonic Assault. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:30:05.207Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
