        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I think it&#39;s working as expected on all ends. &nbsp; You don&#39;t get a prompt about Lead From the Front after preventing damage due to Throat Jab or Hypersonic Assault because the damage is being prevented before they would attempt to deal the damage. &nbsp; In of Undaunted you have to accept the damage before it is prevented for only being one damage and thus Lead From the Front can react at the same time. &nbsp; &nbsp;I would expect to see the same prompts if a Stealth Bot was out and Fanatic with Undaunted out was about to be dealt one damage. &nbsp; To me a better example to compare against is having AZ dealt cold damage from a villain target when he has Null Point Calibration Unit out instead of preventing villain damage through Throat Jab or Hypersonic Assault. &nbsp;</p>",
